# Who may publish the Astra plugins in this repository.
#
# From the registry's cutover, a listing belongs to a Minice account, and this
# file is where the repository says which one: a line `astra-binding: <token>`,
# the first line, written by `astra-plugin init-ci --binding <token>` from a
# token the account minted in the panel. The registry reads it at each release's
# tagged commit, never from the default branch alone, and it covers every plugin
# in the repository. The token is public and authenticates no release: never
# merge a binding line you did not mint yourself.
#
# The login below is what the registry read before the cutover. It is ignored
# now and harmless; `init-ci --binding` keeps it.
#
# See docs/en/5-publish/get-listed.md § "Bind your repository".
mihailinl
